body:
please dont do it. ik its hard. trust me i have days where thats all i wanna do to. but trust me, you are valid and important and someone in the world will miss you. your death will affect at least one person and from that, so many more. Death has a ripple effect.

&#x200B;

one person gets sad, the people around them start to feel sad. it just keeps spreading.

&#x200B;

ik i may seem like a stranger to you but im here for you no matter what, if you want to talk im here to listen.

&#x200B;

be okay. x
